<title>USA: Amway Asia Pacific Ltd ups payout 22.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Amway Asia Pacific Ltd ups payout 22.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.22		     $0.18</p>
<p> Pay	     February 19</p>
<p> Record	   January 30</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>Dividends payable to shareholders of record in Australia and New Zealand will be paid in Australian dollars using the exchange rate of January 30, 1997.</p>
